  "description": "Encryption at rest for GM.FileStorage: every file is encrypted with its own AES-256-GCM key (streamed in authenticated chunks), wrapped by a master key from configuration — e.g. supplied by GM.Secrets. Works on every provider (local disk, S3, Azure Blob), keeps ranged downloads, supports master-key rotation. Register with AddGMFileStorageEncryption().",
